{"articleNo":"55281","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=55281&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 1학기 강의평가 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.15","hit":"11006","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2012학년도 1학기</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">강의평가 참여합시다!!</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">한 학기가 마무리되는 시기입니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">여러분의 적극적인 참여가 교육개선과 향상에 기여하게 될 것입니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">☞ 평가기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 5. 21(월)부터 6. 3(일)까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;위 기간 경과후에는 평가할